    "preamble": "Pradeep Kumar Modi @ Pradeep Modi vs State Of Jharkhand & Ors. ... Opp. ... on 13 May, 2019 Author: Rajesh Shankar Bench: Rajesh Shankar In The High Court Of Jharkhand At Ranchi Cr.M.P. No. 811 of 2014 With I.A. No . 2930 of 2019 Pradeep Kumar Modi @ Pradeep Modi ... Petitioner -V e r s u s- State of Jharkhand & Ors. ... Opp. Parties Coram: - Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Rajesh Shankar",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Mr. Shamim Akhtar, learned counsel for the petitioner, submits that the instant Cr.M.P. was filed by the petitioner for quashing the entire criminal case arising out of C-III 239 of 2013 under Sections 51 and 59 (1) read with Section 3(zx) and 3(zz) (v) and (vi) of the Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006 including the order of cognizance dated 18.07.2013 passed by the learned A.C.J.M., Ranchi in connection with the aforesaid case.",
